# "a spell or ability an opponent controls" (CR 603.2, 102.2, 102.3, 115.1): the ability counts as well as a spell. Bot2's Fanatical
# Firebrand sacrifices itself to deal 1 damage to Ruric Thar on turn two - an ability Bot2 controls - so Bot1 draws a card,
# and the one damage stays marked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Ruric Thar, Biomagus
Opt
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Fanatical Firebrand
Island x18

